  <summary>Fast, native database IDE</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.twoojoo">
    <name>twoojoo</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Lumino is a fast, native desktop IDE for databases: PostgreSQL, MySQL,
      MariaDB, SQLite, SQL Server, Oracle, ClickHouse, CockroachDB, TiDB,
      Firebird, Cassandra/ScyllaDB and Trino. SQL console with completion,
      streaming result grids, table editing, DDL, SSH tunnels, TLS and an AI
      assistant with read-only tools.
    </p>
